    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Integer overflow in tensor size calculation (in_rows * in_cols * in_batch) and num_elements_in_pooling_cell is not explicitly checked in the shown code, but reaching overflow requires all dimensions near INT64_MAX simultaneously, which is unrealistic for actual tensor sizes.",
      "Sequence tensor upper bounds (in_row_start < in_rows, in_col_start < in_cols) are not explicitly validated with their own checks; protection relies on the loop condition (in_row_start <= in_row_end) combined with the std::min cap at in_rows-1.",
